Best Northern Lights Viewing in Finland

Prime Locations:
- Rovaniemi (gateway to Arctic)
- Saariselkä (remote wilderness)
- Kakslauttanen (glass igloos)

Best Time:
- September to March
- Peak months: December-February
- View between 9pm-2am

Tips:
- Download aurora forecast apps
- Dress in thermal layers
- Book tours with local guides
- Stay at least 3 nights for best chances